        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The reassignment of an employee in a full-time career appointment to a partial-year appointment or to a part-time appointment at a fixed or variable percentage of time shall be considered a reduction in time and must be carried out in accordance with the provisions of Article 13 – Layoff and Reduction in Time.",
